# Deterministic seed

- IDs via `deterministicUuid(name)`; never `randomUUID()` / `gen_random_uuid()` for seeded rows.
- Times from `PERIOD_END` / `SEEDED_AT`; never `new Date()` / `now()`. No unseeded randomness.
- Acme Manufacturing / West Distribution Center: metrics, events, insights, scenarios must agree (five problem conditions + healthy areas).
- Running `pnpm db:seed` twice must yield identical data (`tests/integration/seed.test.ts`).
- Update `README.md` counts and demo accounts if they change.

Full guidance: `.cursor/skills/facilityiq-seed-data/SKILL.md`.
